<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>New X-Dogs macro to auto collect reward</Major>
    <Description>Tired of that 6 minutes waiting to claim your daily achievement? This macro is for YOU.

Bind to anykey that you prefer and set the macro to run on repeat. Put mouse on the AFK reward button and press "your binded key" and simply wait.

1920 x 1080 (Must be fullscreen!) on any Emu (Nox, Bluestack, LDPlayer,...).</Description>
    <Comment>Thank you for reviewing my macro, have a wonderful day</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
